    `the person has agreed with the Authority to pay a civil penalty under section 137ZD(4) for the same contravention` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the person entered into an agreement with the Authority to pay, with or without admission of liability, a civil penalty under section 137ZD(4) for the same contravention?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 137ZB(3) no proceedings may be instituted for an offence under section 137ZB` MEANS
    IF `a court has made an order for the payment of a civil penalty under section 137ZD for the same contravention` OR `the person has agreed with the Authority to pay a civil penalty under section 137ZD(4) for the same contravention`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "No proceedings shall be instituted against a person for an offence under this section after"
    -- MARGINAL-READING (b): the bar is limited by its own wording ("after"); outside the limit the other reading is NOTHING.

§ `s 137ZC: duty of the responsible person for a real estate investment trust to make disclosure`

-- src:30758 | 137ZC.—(1) Where the responsible person for a real estate
-- src:30759 | investment trust —
-- src:30761 | (a) acquires or disposes of interests in units in, or debentures
-- src:30762 | or units of debentures of, the real estate investment trust;
-- src:30764 | (aa) acquires or disposes of interests in such securities,
-- src:30765 | securities‑based derivatives contracts or units in a
-- src:30766 | collective investment scheme of the real estate
-- src:30767 | investment trust as may be prescribed by regulations
-- src:30768 | made under section 341; or
-- src:30770 | (b) has been notified in writing by —
-- src:30772 | (i) a substantial unitholder of the real estate investment
-- src:30773 | trust pursuant to a requirement imposed on the
-- src:30774 | substantial unitholder under section 135, 136 or 137
-- src:30775 | as applied by section 137U(1);
-- src:30777 | (ii) a director or chief executive officer of the
-- src:30778 | responsible person pursuant to a requirement
-- src:30779 | imposed on him or her under section 137Y; or
-- src:30781 | (iii) a person who holds an interest or interests in voting
-- src:30782 | shares in the responsible person pursuant to a
-- src:30783 | requirement imposed on the person under
-- src:30784 | section 137ZA,
-- src:30786 | the responsible person must announce or otherwise disseminate the
-- src:30787 | particulars of the acquisition or disposal, or the information stated in
-- src:30788 | the notice it received (as the case may be) to the organised market
-- src:30789 | operated by the approved exchange on whose official list any or all of
-- src:30790 | the units in the trust are listed, as soon as practicable and in any case
-- src:30791 | no later than the end of the business day following the day on which
-- src:30792 | the responsible person became aware of the acquisition or disposal, or
-- src:30793 | received the notice.
@ref s 137ZC(1) (src:30758-30793)
GIVEN
    `the body is the responsible person for a real estate investment trust` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body the responsible person for a real estate investment trust within section 137S?
    `the units in the trust are listed on the official list of an approved exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are any or all of the units in the trust listed on the official list of an approved exchange?
    `the responsible person has acquired or disposed of interests in units in, or debentures or units of debentures of, the real estate investment trust` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the responsible person acquired or disposed of interests in units in, or debentures or units of debentures of, the real estate investment trust?
    `the responsible person has acquired or disposed of interests in securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme of the real estate investment trust that the regulations prescribe` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the responsible person acquired or disposed of interests in such securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme of the real estate investment trust as regulations made under section 341 prescribe?
    `the responsible person has been notified in writing by a substantial unitholder of the real estate investment trust under section 135, 136 or 137 as applied by section 137U(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the responsible person been notified in writing by a substantial unitholder of the real estate investment trust, pursuant to a requirement imposed under section 135, 136 or 137 as applied by section 137U(1)?
    `the responsible person has been notified in writing by a director or chief executive officer of the responsible person under section 137Y` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the responsible person been notified in writing by a director or chief executive officer of the responsible person, pursuant to a requirement imposed under section 137Y?
    `the responsible person has been notified in writing by a person who holds an interest in voting shares in the responsible person under section 137ZA` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the responsible person been notified in writing by a person who holds an interest or interests in voting shares in the responsible person, pursuant to a requirement imposed under section 137ZA?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 137ZC(1) the responsible person must announce or disseminate the particulars or the information stated in the notice` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the body is the responsible person for a real estate investment trust`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the responsible person for a real estate investment trust"; the body is not one
        IF NOT `the units in the trust are listed on the official list of an approved exchange`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the approved exchange on whose official list any or all of the units in the trust are listed"
        IF `the responsible person has acquired or disposed of interests in units in, or debentures or units of debentures of, the real estate investment trust` OR `the responsible person has acquired or disposed of interests in securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme of the real estate investment trust that the regulations prescribe` OR `the responsible person has been notified in writing by a substantial unitholder of the real estate investment trust under section 135, 136 or 137 as applied by section 137U(1)` OR `the responsible person has been notified in writing by a director or chief executive officer of the responsible person under section 137Y` OR `the responsible person has been notified in writing by a person who holds an interest in voting shares in the responsible person under section 137ZA`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the responsible person for a real estate investment trust"

-- The time: "as soon as practicable and in any case no later than the end of the business day following the day on which the responsible person became aware of the acquisition or
-- disposal, or received the notice". "As soon as practicable" is not measured, so the functions answer on the hard limit only (fork register B9).
-- src:30786 | the responsible person must announce or otherwise disseminate the
-- src:30787 | particulars of the acquisition or disposal, or the information stated in
-- src:30788 | the notice it received (as the case may be) to the organised market
-- src:30789 | operated by the approved exchange on whose official list any or all of
-- src:30790 | the units in the trust are listed, as soon as practicable and in any case
-- src:30791 | no later than the end of the business day following the day on which
-- src:30792 | the responsible person became aware of the acquisition or disposal, or
-- src:30793 | received the notice.
@ref s 137ZC(1) (src:30786-30793)
