    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): SPLIT-SITE (i) the text says who is guilty ("any officer of the responsible person who" "causes the responsible person to contravene subsection (1)"), not that anyone else is innocent

